source_language:
It'd be really useful if I could fire a bow more accurately
from horseback. Think we could work on my riding,
along with my bow skills?

If we can rely on any of the major Kingdom houses
for military support, it would be...House Charon,
I'd wager.

I killed soldiers from my homeland, stole weapons
from their corpses, and made my escape,
soaked in their blood...

It was, after all, founded with the goal of freedom
from Faerghus. We prize that independence highly,
even if it occasionally hinders cooperation.

In two days' time you'll have a terrible case of...
let's call it stomach trouble. It's a peaceful poison,
so you'll live, but you'll certainly be inconvenienced.

destination_language:
Ваши навыки владения мечом безупречны;
вы талантливый педагог. Вам явно нравится
работать со студентами.

source_language:
I intend to set things right. And once I expose you
for the fraud you are, and reclaim my rightful place,
that is precisely what I will do.

I'd do anything in the world for Lady Rhea...
except die. If she asked me to die for her,
I wouldn't.

destination_language:
Она выглядит юной, но ведёт себя старомодно;
она эрудирована, но не знает многих очевидных
вещей...
